            "expected echo (+{0} s)",
            "The Moon is not in the GRAVES beam right now: the step detail appears when it enters a sector.",
            "The sequence is tied to UTC time (PE1ITR): since 2021 the steps last 0.8 s and a sector cycle 4.8 s; in 2007 they were 3.2 s and 19.2 s. The control station sometimes shifts the sequence by a few steps: the detail is a prediction to be confirmed by listening.",
