            "new calculation ({0} MHz, {1}, {2})",
            "selected day",
            "Distance affects all bands equally; what changes is the weight of sky noise. Where the Moon crosses the Milky Way, the new calculation gives a less severe Dgrd, because the wide antenna beam “sees” an average of the hot region, not just its hottest point. The best days (★) in Distance and Dgrd are computed with the new Dgrd.",
