            "S/N ek → DX",
            "S/N DX → ek",
            "in {0:0} Hz · {1} dB in 2500 Hz",
            "in {0:0} Hz met die Son · {1} dB in 2500 Hz",
            "{0} by die antenna (TX-verliese {1:F1} dB) · {2:F1} dBi",
