            "CFOM-frekvens: {0} MHz\nEkko: {1} Hz\nTX: {2} MHz\nRX: {3} MHz\n\nDgrd: {4:F1} dB\nTsky: {5:F0} K\nDeklination: {6:F2}°\nTimevinkel: {7:F1}°\nAfstand: {8:N0} km",
